    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaloli babili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ndaheebwa litundu eliokhuchela, elifwana shinga indabushi; nimboolelwa mbu otsie ochele ihekalu yaNyasaye, nende eshimalilo shiemisango, nende abo abeenamilangamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwanyi oluli elwanyi weihekalu, lekha lube; oraluchela ta; okhuba lwaheebwa abamahanga; nabo balaseenela litookho litakatifu hasi wamakulu kabwe emiesi amakhumi kane nachibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndalaheelesia abaloli banje babili obunyali, nabo balalakulanga tsindaalo eshikhumila ebikhumi bibili namakhumi kasasaba, nibeefuubila amakunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo nibo emitseituni echio chibili khandi nebichibi bietsitaha ebio bibili ebibeetsangaho imbeli wOmwami weshialo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu yesi naba niyeenya okhuboonoonia, omulilo kurulanga muminwa chiabwe nikulia abasuku babwe; kata omundu yesi naba niyeenya okhuboonoonia, khatimba yeerwe ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeenabo bali nobunyali okhwikala likulu ifula yileshenje okhukwa mundaalo tsiobulakusi bwabwe; khandi bali nobunyali khumatsi okhukakwisia amabanga, nende okhuupa eshialo namanyasio kosi, akhandi akhanji shmga abeene olwa baleenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa balaba nibamalile oburumbusi bwabwe, isolo eyo eyirula mubuko yilabaseera, niyibahula, niyibeera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nachio emilambo chiabwe chilakona khunjila yelitookho likali elilangungwa mushiroho mbu Sodoma, khandi Misiri; ne yaho niho aha Omwami wabwe yabambilwa khumusalaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsindaalo tsitaru neinusu, abarula mubuli bandu, nende mubuli luyia, nende mubuli lulimi, nende mubuli balahenganga emilambo chiabwe, nibarafuchiilila emilambo tsana okhubiikhwa mushilindwa ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abo abamenya mushialo balabeekhoyela, nibatsatsahala; khandi balakoobelana ebihaanwashichila abanabii abo bali nibabasaalisinjia abamenya mushialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olunyuma lwetsindaalo etsio tsitaru neinusu emiuya chiobulamu echirula ewaNyasaye nichiinjila mbu, nabo nibasinjila nebilenje biabwe; oburii obunji nibubahamba abo ababalola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibahulila omwoyo omukhongo okurula mwikulu nikubaboolela kuri Tikulushe mwitse hano. Nabo nibakulukha nibatsia mwikulu mwileesi; abasuku babwe nibabalola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mushise shieneshio eshialo shiarenga obutinyu, eshitonye shielikhumi shielitookho nishikwa; ne abeerwa mukhurenga khweshialo okhwo bali abandu ebikhumila musaafu; nabo abasikala indenga yabatiila, nibamuheelesia Nyasaye owelikulu oluyali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
