          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ihekalu yaNyasaye eyili mwikulu niyiikulwa; lisanduku lieindakanoye nalio nililoleshela muhekaluye; mana nibibaho tsimbenu, nemioyo, nemikukumo, nokhurenga khweshialo, nende ifula yamachina amanji muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
